msgid ""
"Opens the accessible Power Editor dialog to edit the active cell's contents."
msgstr "Otevře přístupný dialog Power Editor pro úpravu obsahu aktivní buňky."

msgid ""
"Opens the Active Cell Monitors dialog to manage and jump to monitored cells."
